#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:98
#: 490a29a0fdf1417f97088f3bef55b657
msgid "Compass"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:100
#: 564d0560909347698954647057603409
msgid "The AP-H743v2 has a built-in compass sensor (IST8310), and you can also attach an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL connectors. Due to potential interference, the autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as part of a GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:103
